## Smell-Free Pattern — Good Example

`ValidateOrder_NullOrder_ThrowsArgumentNullException` (line 155) is clean:
- Uses `Assert.ThrowsException<T>` (no manual try/catch)
- Single focused assertion on `ex.ParamName`
- No magic numbers, no external resources, no sleep

This is the pattern to follow.

