## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Fix | Rationale |
|----------|-------|-----|-----------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free Test | Add assertions | **False-pass risk** — this test proves nothing today |
| 2 | Conditional Test Logic | Split into 2 tests | One branch is **never verified** per run |
| 3 | Sleepy Test | `async`/`await` | **Flaky + slow** — 2 s penalty per run |
| 4 | Mystery Guest | Inline test data | **Breaks on every machine** without `C:\TestData\` |
| 5 | Exception Handling | `Assert.ThrowsException` | Quick one-liner swap |
| 6 | Sensitive Equality | Assert on typed properties | Prevents formatting-change breakage |
| 7 | Eager Test | Split or mark integration | Improves failure diagnosis |
| 8 | Magic Number + Assertion Roulette | Named constants + messages | Improves readability & diagnosis |
| 9 | General Fixture | Remove unused `_logger` | Minor cleanup |

Fixes 1–5 are quick wins (< 5 min each). Fixes 6–8 need modest refactoring. Fix 9 is a one-line delete.
